Linux Embedded Automotive Platform

A C++ Linux embedded automotive platform simulating
multiple ECUs communicating over a CAN bus.

Status
------
Early development.

Current milestone
-----------------
V0.1 - Project architecture and initial engine ECU.

Technologies
------------
- C++17
- Linux
- CMake
- Doxygen
- GDB
- SocketCAN
- systemd
- Yocto Project (planned)

Roadmap
-------
- [x] Project structure
- [x] Engine ECU
- [x] Engine simulation
- [x] CAN communication
- [ ] Multiple ECUs
- [ ] Gateway
- [ ] Unit tests
- [ ] systemd services
- [ ] Watchdog
- [ ] Yocto Linux image